.TH valloc 3 2025\-12\-13 "Linux man\-pages (未リリース)" 
.SH 名前
valloc \- page\-aligned memory allocation
.SH ライブラリ
標準 C ライブラリ (\fIlibc\fP,\~\fI\-lc\fP)
.SH 書式
.nf
\fB#include <stdlib.h>\fP
.P
\fB[[deprecated]] void *valloc(size_t \fP\fIsize\fP\fB);\fP
.fi
.P
.RS -4
glibc 向けの機能検査マクロの要件 (\fBfeature_test_macros\fP(7)  参照):
.RE
.P
\fBvalloc\fP():
.nf
.\"    || _XOPEN_SOURCE && _XOPEN_SOURCE_EXTENDED
    Since glibc 2.12:
        (_XOPEN_SOURCE >= 500) && !(_POSIX_C_SOURCE >= 200112L)
            || /* glibc >= 2.19: */ _DEFAULT_SOURCE
            || /* glibc <= 2.19: */ _SVID_SOURCE || _BSD_SOURCE
    Before glibc 2.12:
        _BSD_SOURCE || _XOPEN_SOURCE >= 500
.fi
.SH 説明
\fBvalloc\fP()  allocates \fIsize\fP bytes and returns a pointer to the allocated
memory.  The memory address will be a multiple of the page size.
.P
It is equivalent to \fImemalign(sysconf(_SC_PAGESIZE),size)\fP.
